    """Eski qatorlarga recorded_at = sana + 12:00 (Tashkent), source = mavjud
    indicator_type.system_key'ga qarab `diet_ai` yoki `manual`.

    Optimallashtirish: SQLite lock pressure'ni kamaytirish uchun `bulk_update`
    chunk'larda, har chunk alohida tranzaksiya (migration `atomic=False`).
    """
